                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you like playing games with a couch full of friends you're going to love Bugspeed Collider. Imagine Towerfall but you can fly. Or imagine Smash Bros but you can destroy everything in the environment. Obviously those comparisons are only scratching the surface of what makes this game great, but if that sounds appealing you owe it to yourself to check out Bugspeed Collider!",
